SIGNS (exists_signs): nonempty multisets on Z_n with at most M elements; those with no good signing
  n =   1  M = 6:        6 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =   3  M = 6:       83 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =   5  M = 6:      461 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =   9  M = 6:     5004 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  15  M = 6:    54263 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  21  M = 5:    65779 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  25  M = 5:   142505 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  27  M = 5:   201375 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  35  M = 4:    82250 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  45  M = 4:   211875 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  63  M = 4:   766479 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n =  75  M = 3:    76075 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  n = 105 (three odd primes: outside the statement)  M = 3:   204155 multisets, 0 without a good signing
  together 1810310 multisets
  controls, which must fail (even n, outside the statement):
  n =   2  M = 3:        9 multisets, 1 without a good signing; first (0, 1)
  n =   6  M = 3:       83 multisets, 9 without a good signing; first (0, 1)
  n =   4  M = 3:       34 multisets, 6 without a good signing; first (0, 1)
LIFT ALONG 2 (exists_lift_two): nonempty multisets on Z_N with at most M elements; those with no lift to Z_2N free of new cyclotomic divisors
  N =   1  M = 6:        6 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   2  M = 6:       27 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   3  M = 6:       83 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   4  M = 6:      209 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   5  M = 5:      251 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   6  M = 5:      461 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   8  M = 5:     1286 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =   9  M = 5:     2001 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  10  M = 5:     3002 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  12  M = 5:     6187 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  15  M = 4:     3875 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  18  M = 4:     7314 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  20  M = 4:    10625 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  24  M = 4:    20474 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  30  M = 4:    46375 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  36  M = 3:     9138 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  45  M = 3:    17295 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  N =  60  M = 3:    39710 multisets, 0 without such a lift
  together 168319 multisets
  control, which must fail (asked that no cyclotomic polynomial at all divide the lift; a multiset that is all of Z_3 cannot have that):
  N =   3  M = 3:       19 multisets, 1 without such a lift; first (0, 1, 2)
  N =   6  M = 3:       83 multisets, 17 without such a lift; first (0, 1)
